  "description": "Framework-agnostic core for Server-Sent Events (SSE) assertions in .NET test projects. WHATWG / W3C-compliant SseFrameParser turning wire-format text into IReadOnlyList<SseEvent>; SseFailureMessage factories for consumer-authored typed assertions; SseCountComparison enum backing count terminators. Test-framework-specific assertion entry points live in adapter packages (SseAssertions.TUnit ships today; xUnit, NUnit, MSTest adapters are possible if there is demand). AOT-compatible, trimmable, no runtime reflection.",
